  "description": "The Voopoo Argus G3 Mini Pod Vape Kit delivers impressive performance in a compact, beginner-friendly format. With a 1350mAh built-in battery and up to 30W output, the G3 Mini supports both mouth-to-lung (MTL) and restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) vaping styles using the Argus pod platform. Smart Mode takes the guesswork out of setup by automatically adjusting the power output based on the pod’s coil resistance. Simply insert your pod and inhale—no buttons or menus required. A discrete LED indicator shows battery status at a glance, and USB-C fast charging keeps downtime to a minimum. The G3 Mini uses the latest Argus V2 top-fill pods with built-in mesh coils for clean, consistent flavour. Each kit includes a 0.7ohm pod that delivers a smooth and flavourful vape, with a leak-resistant design and a convenient silicone-sealed fill port. Airflow control allows you to fine-tune your draw for a tighter or more open inhale, adding flexibility without complexity. With a slim profile, quality build and easy operation, the Argus G3 Mini is ideal for new vapers and anyone looking for a no-fuss everyday vape. Complete your setup by choosing a vape juice uk flavour that naturally suits this kit. We recommend using the following E-Liquid: Voopoo Argus V2 0.7ohm Pod - Use Nic Salts or 50/50 (freebase) Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Pods, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
